    "manas-2010:p0332:b001:l014": "Калдай is rendered governor following the historical administrative rank in Yudakhin and the shared working glossary. The magician in this sequence may additionally bear it as a title; no modern office is implied.",
    "manas-2010:p0324:b001:l038": "Карыпчы denotes an arm guard, not generic armor; калдайтып means spreading/broadening and is not the neighboring governor title.",
